<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee weakens on dollar and pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee weakens on dollar and pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee was fixed weaker against both the dollar and the pound on Thursday, commercial banks forex dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was quoted at a mean rate of 20.6015 against the dollar from 20.5470 on Wednesday. Against the pound, the rupee was fixed at a mean of 32.1600 from 32.1400 on Wednesday.</p>
